  "job_B19.2.1_20251003_114441": {
    "chunk_text": "dbur, \u00fea s\u00e6de heo \u00feam brydguman NO22A11 \u00dea gel\u00e6rde heo \u00feone brydguman \u00fe\u00e6t he onfeng fullwyhte ond on god gelyfde. NO22A13 \u00dea he gefullod w\u00e6s ond yneode on \u00feone brydbur, \u00fea stod se engel big hyre myd NO22A17 and \u00fea sealde he o\u00f0erne \u00fe\u00e6ra beaga \u00fe\u00e6re f\u00e6mnan and o\u00f0erne \u00feam brydguman and cw\u00e6\u00f0, NO22A21 \u00deeos f\u00e6mne ge\u00ferowode martyrdom for Cryste. NO22A22 Almatheus hatte Romeburge gerefa. NO22A23 He nydde hig \u00fe\u00e6t heo Cryste wy\u00f0soce. NO22A24 \u00dea heo \u00fe\u00e6t ne ge\u00feafode, \u00fea het he hig belucan on byrnendum ba\u00f0e, on \u00feam heo w\u00e6s d\u00e6g NO22A27 \u00dea eode hyre se cwellere to myd sweorde, ond he hig sloh \u00ferywa myd \u00feam sweorde ond he NO22A29 Ac heo geb\u00e6d hig to \u00feam papan, se w\u00e6s haten Urbanus, ond \u00fea beforan \u00feam papan heo NO22A35 Ond heo \u00fea onsende hyre gast to gode. NO23A1 On \u00feone \u00fereo ond twentigo\u00f0an d\u00e6g \u00fe\u00e6s mon\u00f0es by\u00f0 sancti Clementis tyd \u00fe\u00e6s papan. NO23A2 \u00deone Sanctus Petrus sylf gehalgode to papan and hym sealde \u00fea ylcan myhte \u00fee Dryhten NO23A6 \u00dear \u00fees Clementes gedyde \u00feurh hys gebed \u00fe\u00e6t of \u00fe\u00e6re eor\u00f0an w\u00e6ter upp arn, \u00fe\u00e6r \u00e6r n\u00e6nig NO23A8 Ond Traianus se casere onsende hys heretogan, se w\u00e6s on naman Aufidianus,",
